    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=670 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evercore Heroes: Ascension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>co-op-first Hero Roguelite</strong> where teamwork and mastery forge legends.\u00a0Each run is a high-stakes gauntlet of enemies, strategy, and role mastery. Whether you fight <strong>solo, as duo or with a full team of three</strong>, every mission is a new challenge.\u00a0<strong>Fall, rise stronger, and protect the Evercore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND THE EVERCORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Luum Sentinel</strong>, you are one of the last heroes standing against Fate\u2019s Blade, a sinister force seeking to corrupt Lumerea\u2019s magic. The Evercore\u2014source of balance and life\u2014has been shattered, and only by recovering its fragments can you restore order before chaos takes hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/3f040b3881d5e2a5157c79bc308f4a45.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=62 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/65d100fbbc3408d3e4549c72114258db.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/65d100fbbc3408d3e4549c72114258db.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/65d100fbbc3408d3e4549c72114258db.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRUE CO-OP HERO ROGUELITE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for teamwork, but fully playable solo</strong>, every mission challenges your coordination, adaptability, and execution. Play your role, cover your allies, and overcome impossible odds together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MISSIONS, ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch from Castle Everae into <strong>procedural missions</strong> full of deadly monsters, layered objectives, and intense boss fights\u2014all wrapped into <strong>tight 30-minute adventures</strong>. Each run is different. Every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/d901d1d7d2cd8f6d6a443e2fa8da03f5.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=62 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4683a4e083e839cefc759fe8b819a31a.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4683a4e083e839cefc759fe8b819a31a.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4683a4e083e839cefc759fe8b819a31a.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER UNIQUE HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and refine a growing roster of <strong>class-based Heroes</strong>\u2014Tank, Damage, and Support\u2014each with distinct powers, playstyles, and bold personalities. <strong>Six Heroes</strong> will be available at Early Access launch, with <strong>over a dozen total planned</strong> by full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/7daa5b534e6fc95590381b2e383377d1.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4eae4f357bfd0774c4d02f4df7a1e3f8.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4eae4f357bfd0774c4d02f4df7a1e3f8.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4eae4f357bfd0774c4d02f4df7a1e3f8.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your role and <strong>break the meta</strong> with <strong>Shards</strong>\u2014in-run, game-changing upgrades that reshape your build and let you adapt your Hero in powerful new ways. Experiment, refine, and surprise the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/fcdbe1fd12dd885d32570dc14081b915.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/21c1ce3cc86e42fe532485fc91136ffb.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/21c1ce3cc86e42fe532485fc91136ffb.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/21c1ce3cc86e42fe532485fc91136ffb.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress persists</strong>. Unlock <strong>Core Powers</strong>\u2014meta progression that strengthens your Heroes between runs to go further each time. Victory or defeat, you're always advancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/fbba6eec543db52dc8a1694ee59ed416.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ace6f9b14723468ce22a295b00cc9985.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ace6f9b14723468ce22a295b00cc9985.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ace6f9b14723468ce22a295b00cc9985.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A LIVING SCIENCE-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the <strong>Five Realms of Lumerea</strong>, beginning with the frozen peaks and mines of <strong>Kru</strong> to the vibrant jungles of <strong>Moxy</strong>. Discover a world full of danger, beauty, and hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally your team, embrace the challenge, and become the heroes Lumerea needs!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=670 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/0d4f15a82a0aea4758b8ff9795b2f5ae.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evercore Heroes: Ascension</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>co-op-first Hero Roguelite</strong> where teamwork and mastery forge legends.\u00a0Each run is a high-stakes gauntlet of enemies, strategy, and role mastery. Whether you fight <strong>solo, as duo or with a full team of three</strong>, every mission is a new challenge.\u00a0<strong>Fall, rise stronger, and protect the Evercore!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEFEND THE EVERCORE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>Luum Sentinel</strong>, you are one of the last heroes standing against Fate\u2019s Blade, a sinister force seeking to corrupt Lumerea\u2019s magic. The Evercore\u2014source of balance and life\u2014has been shattered, and only by recovering its fragments can you restore order before chaos takes hold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/3f040b3881d5e2a5157c79bc308f4a45.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=62 /></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/65d100fbbc3408d3e4549c72114258db.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/65d100fbbc3408d3e4549c72114258db.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/65d100fbbc3408d3e4549c72114258db.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TRUE CO-OP HERO ROGUELITE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Designed for teamwork, but fully playable solo</strong>, every mission challenges your coordination, adaptability, and execution. Play your role, cover your allies, and overcome impossible odds together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DYNAMIC MISSIONS, ENDLESS REPLAYABILITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch from Castle Everae into <strong>procedural missions</strong> full of deadly monsters, layered objectives, and intense boss fights\u2014all wrapped into <strong>tight 30-minute adventures</strong>. Each run is different. Every decision counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/d901d1d7d2cd8f6d6a443e2fa8da03f5.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=62 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4683a4e083e839cefc759fe8b819a31a.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4683a4e083e839cefc759fe8b819a31a.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4683a4e083e839cefc759fe8b819a31a.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MASTER UNIQUE HEROES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and refine a growing roster of <strong>class-based Heroes</strong>\u2014Tank, Damage, and Support\u2014each with distinct powers, playstyles, and bold personalities. <strong>Six Heroes</strong> will be available at Early Access launch, with <strong>over a dozen total planned</strong> by full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/7daa5b534e6fc95590381b2e383377d1.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4eae4f357bfd0774c4d02f4df7a1e3f8.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4eae4f357bfd0774c4d02f4df7a1e3f8.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/4eae4f357bfd0774c4d02f4df7a1e3f8.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EVOLVE YOUR PLAYSTYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your role and <strong>break the meta</strong> with <strong>Shards</strong>\u2014in-run, game-changing upgrades that reshape your build and let you adapt your Hero in powerful new ways. Experiment, refine, and surprise the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/fcdbe1fd12dd885d32570dc14081b915.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=62 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/21c1ce3cc86e42fe532485fc91136ffb.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/21c1ce3cc86e42fe532485fc91136ffb.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/21c1ce3cc86e42fe532485fc91136ffb.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR LEGACY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress persists</strong>. Unlock <strong>Core Powers</strong>\u2014meta progression that strengthens your Heroes between runs to go further each time. Victory or defeat, you're always advancing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/fbba6eec543db52dc8a1694ee59ed416.avif?t=1754577957\" data-has-big width=800 height=54 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ace6f9b14723468ce22a295b00cc9985.poster.avif?t=1754577957\" width=672 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ace6f9b14723468ce22a295b00cc9985.webm?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2586780/extras/ace6f9b14723468ce22a295b00cc9985.mp4?t=1754577957\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EXPLORE A LIVING SCIENCE-FANTASY WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through the <strong>Five Realms of Lumerea</strong>, beginning with the frozen peaks and mines of <strong>Kru</strong> to the vibrant jungles of <strong>Moxy</strong>. Discover a world full of danger, beauty, and hidden stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally your team, embrace the challenge, and become the heroes Lumerea needs!</strong></p>",
